                    <div class="product attribute description">
        <div class="value" ><h2 class="subtitle-description">More details about Hanna HI98301 PPM Tester DIST-1:</h2> The HI98301 DiST 1 has a 0.5 conversion factor in the measurement of TDS in a variety of applications including water conditioning, environmental monitoring, education and general laboratory use. This tester keeps things simple with a two-button operation; one for ON/OFF, the other for calibration.<br> <br> Features<br> <ul>  <li>Large Multi-level LCD</li>  <li>Exposed Temperature Probe for Fast Response</li>  <li>Simple Two-Button Operation</li> </ul></div>
